cfg.sync_status:
🔗 <b>Settings sync: {state}</b>
{detail}
Change it with <code>/sync on</code> or <code>/sync off</code> (or from /config).

hdl.bot_added_kicked:
🤖 <b>Bot added and removed</b>
📍 Chat: {chat}
🤖 Bot: @{bot_username} (<code>{bot_id}</code>)
👤 Added by: {adder}{adder_id}

<i>I removed it as a precaution. If it is legitimate, add it again and grant it permissions.</i>

hdl.channel_banned:
{prefix}🚫 <b>Channel banned for spamming in the comments</b>
📍 Chat: {chat}
📢 Channel: {channel} (<code>{channel_id}</code>)
📖 Reason: {rule}

hdl.via_bot_deleted:
⚠️ <b>Spam message via inline bot deleted</b>
📍 Chat: {chat}
👤 User: <a href="tg://user?id={uid}">{name}</a> (<code>{uid}</code>)
🤖 Via bot: @{via_bot}
🔘 {n_buttons} spam buttons

<i>I have not banned them (they may be an established user). If you want, reply to their message with /ban or use their id.</i>

hdl.shadow_notice:
🌒 <b>[SHADOW MODE — no action taken]</b>
📍 Chat: {chat}
👤 {user_link} (<code>{uid}</code>)
⚖️ {would}
📖 Reason: {reason}
🚨 Rule: <code>{rule}</code>
📏 Score: {score}

<i>This is test mode: set MODE=active in the .env for it to act for real.</i>

admin.start:
🤖 <b>CazaSpamBot up and running</b>

{mode_emoji} <b>Mode:</b> <code>{mode}</code>
🌐 <b>Federation:</b> {federation}
🛡️ <b>CAS:</b> {cas}
❤️ <b>Reactions:</b> {reactions}
📜 <b>Allowed scripts:</b> {scripts}

📊 <b>Stats</b>
  Chats: <b>{chats}</b> · Users seen: <b>{seen_users}</b>
  Active bans: <b>{banned}</b> · Actions 24h: <b>{actions_24h}</b>

Use /help to see every command.

hdl.review_dm:
🔎 <b>Spam review</b>

👤 <code>{uid}</code> ({name}) · trust {trust}
📍 {chat}
🚨 Rules: <code>{rules}</code>
⚖️ Proposed action: <b>{action}</b>
💬 Reason: {reason}

<b>Message:</b>
<pre>{text}</pre>

tb.manual_delete:
🗑️ <b>Message deleted manually</b>
📍 Chat: {chat}
👮 Deleted by: {actor}
👤 Message author: {author_link} (<code>{author_id}</code>){state}
🆔 msg_id: <code>{msg_id}</code>

<b>Content:</b>
<pre>{content}</pre>
